[sub_resource type="RoseDialogLine" id="RoseDialogLine_ldat2"]
text = "Look, one night, those guys in the red costumes came to me and told me about the hourglass. They probably knew that I can't resist my curiosity, and sure, I thought they were suspicious, but they mentioned something about making sure that the hourglass was working. And before I knew it, I pulled the {fc=14}Crystal Key{/fc} out."
